# Root-level ignores. frontend/ and backend/ each have their own .gitignore too.

# Product photos are large binaries that land here as a staging area — they
# get uploaded to S3 via the admin panel, not committed to the repo (same
# reasoning as not committing node_modules).
product-images/*
!product-images/README.md

# Hero/marketing banner images (not per-SKU product shots) — same reasoning.
banners/*
!banners/README.md
